            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.3.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jeremia 3:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Josiya kala ana miaka minane ariphoandza kutawala. Naye watawala miaka mirongo mihahu na mmwenga ko Jerusalemu. Nine kala anaihwa Jedida, mwana mchetu wa Adaya kula mudzi wa Bosikathi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Josiya wahenda garigo sawa mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu. Walunga njira za mkarewe Daudi, kayagaluka uphande wa kulume wala wa kumotso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka wa kumi na nane wa utawalawe, mfalume Josiya wamuhuma muandishi Shafani, mwana wa Azaliya, mwana wa Meshulamu, aphiye nyumbani kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu, achiamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ambuka uphiye kpwa Hilikiya, mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu, ili aphahe kuolanga feza zorehwa ndani ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, ambazo arindzi a mryango azikusanya kula kpwa atu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nazo zilaviwe kpwa ahendadzi-kazi ambao kala anaimirira nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, ili nao akaaphe ahendadzi-kazi, ambao a mo nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, ili arekebishe yo nyumba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yani mafundi a mbao, na mafundi a kudzenga na mawe, na mafundi anjina ili agule mbao na mawe ga kutsongbwa kpwa ajili ya kurekebisha yo nyumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.12.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Afalume 12:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu anaoimirira ujendzi asivoywe kulavya isabu ya mahumizi ga feza ndizohewa, kpwa sababu aho anazihumira kpwa uaminifu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hilikiya, mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu, achimuamba muandishi Shafani, “Nkatsola chitabu cha Shariya ndani ya yo nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu.” Chisha Hilikiya achimupha Shafani cho chitabu, naye achichisoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muandishi Shafani waphiya kpwa mfalume achimupha yo habari achiamba, “Atumishio akatuluza feza zichizophahikana kpwenye nyumba, nazo zikahewa mafundi anaoimirira kazi ya kurekebisha yo nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu Shafani, muandishi wamuambira mfalume, “Mlavyadzi-sadaka Hilikiya akanipha chitabu.” Naye Shafani achichisoma mbere za mfalume.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalume ariphosikira maneno ga Chitabu cha Shariya, wakpwanyula nguwoze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalume achimlagiza mlavyadzi-sadaka Hilikiya, Ahikamu mwana wa Shafani, Akibori mwana wa Mikaya, muandishi Shafani na Asaya mtumishi wa mfalume, achiamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Phiyani mkauze mashauri kula kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu kpwa ajili yangu, na kpwa ajili ya atu, na kpwa ajili ya Juda yosi, kuhusu maneno ga chitabu chirichoonewa. Kpwa mana tsukizi za Mwenyezi Mlungu zi dzulu yehu, mana akare ehu taayalunga maneno ga chitabu chichi na kutimiza gosi garigoandikpwa dzulu yehu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo mlavyadzi-sadaka Hilikiya, Ahikamu, Akibori, Shafani na Asaya, osi aphiya kpwendauza mashauri kpwa nabii wa chichetu yeihwa Hulida ariyekala mkpwaza Shalumu mwana wa Tikiva, mwana wa Harihasi, muimirizi wa mavwazi ga mfalume.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Au",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "muimirizi wa nyumba ya Mlungu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wakati hinyo, Hulida kala anaishi lalo ra phiri ra Jerusalemu, nao achibisha naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Hulida waambira, “Hivi ndivyo Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli, anavyoamba mumuambire hiye achiyeahuma kpwangu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kukala Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi: Nindareha uyi phatu phapha na dzulu ya atu asagalao phapha dza vyo maneno gosi ga chitabu chirichosomwa ni ye mfalume wa Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa kukala akaniricha na akafukizira milungu yanjina uvumba ili atu anitsukize na kazi zosi azihendazo, phahi, tsukizi zangu zindaaka chinyume cha phatu phapha na tazindaweza kuhurizwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ye mfalume wa Juda, chiyekuhumani mumuuze kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu, kuhusu maneno achigogasikira, kamuambireni kukala Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli anaamba hivi kuhusu go maneno urigosikira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa kukala moyoo ukakubali upesi nawe ukagbwa maguluni mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu uchiphosikira manenoge chinyume cha phatu phapha na atu asagalao mumo, kukala pho phatu phandakala gandzo, na atu alaniwe, nawe ukakpwanyula mavwazigo na kurira mbere zangu, mimi nami nkakusikira, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo, undafwa dza akareo nawe undazikpwa kpwa amani, matsogo tagandaona nyo uyi ndinyoureha phatu phapha.” Phahi achimrehera nyo ujumbe ye mfalume.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
